  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A wall, a ball, and nobody else needed. That's the whole session.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Marks at three and five metres, and twenty clean exchanges at each one.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 12.79,
   "text": "Pass into the wall, take the return with one touch, play it with the second.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 32.88,
   "text": "Alternate feet every exchange. The wall never gives you a kind bounce to hide on.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 36.53,
   "text": "Once that's clean, receive across the body and return with the far foot only.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
   "t": 39.03,
   "text": "The wall is the most honest team-mate in football. It returns what you give.",
